title: "Ordination stability audit — core code"
abstract: "Study-level deletion-stability audit for pooled ordinations: Procrustes drift, volume-matched controls, block-percentile and grade-stability metrics, and a curated primary-set audit that removes the known re-publication pair and single-row exceptions."
